+# M1-64 hint reader evidence
+
+7 November 2026. Candidate on base b5372ed; final full acceptance is held for independent review and upstream integration. These are real 1280x720 Godot Forward+ captures with isolated user storage and prepared rendering-cache directories. No generated assets, registry edits or campaign-save changes.
+
+The first corrected full capture printed `M1-64 CAPTURE RESULT: PASS (26 captures, 0 failures)`. Its initial title-card still and mislabelled 150% campaign levels were superseded by the targeted batches below. The PNGs listed here are the final versions; the original full probe/log are historical for the unaffected screens.
+
+- `M1-64_still_native_log.txt` / `M1-64_still_capture_probe.txt`: `PASS (4 captures, 0 failures)`. The registered `sci_polar_sun.ogv` is decoded muted and hidden until its first science caption at 4.4 seconds. The actual exposed globe/sunlight frame is paused at 4.50315333333334 seconds, texture hash 4203758741, with identical pixels and position after half a second. No Pause/Replay action is offered under reduced motion.
+- `M1-64_context_native_log.txt` / `M1-64_context_capture_probe.txt`: `PASS (10 captures, 0 failures)`. A genuine requested H1 remains open while normal/150% text is captured; the next actual Journal request opens H2, then its text size changes. Level/title assertions guard the filenames. Authored S01 H1 and the visible existing world marker are checked at both sizes. The table H1 also uses its authored safe nudge.
+- `M1-64_layout_red_log.txt`: preserved 71-check/4-failure layout RED. `M1-64_layout_still_red_log.txt`: stronger 83-check/17-failure RED for readable actions, visible nudge/media, honest concept heading and unexposed blank texture. `M1-64_still_red_native_log.txt`: the title-only frame fails the scientific-frame assertion. `M1-64_context_red_log.txt`: authored-H1 RED, 85 checks/1 failure.
+- `M1-64_test_results.txt` records the final filtered runner results. Every filtered run uses `game/tools/run_tests.sh`; the final full runner remains a controller gate. Historical 53/54 integration on Task5 failed only existing Atik M1-68 performance timing and does not certify this candidate.
+
+| Screen/state | Normal text | 150% text |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Shared table Hint entry | M1-64_table_hint_entry.png | M1-64_table_hint_entry_150.png |
+| H1 actual table row highlight | M1-64_hint_1.png | M1-64_hint_1_150.png |
+| H2 real media and captions | M1-64_hint_2_caption_pause.png | M1-64_hint_2_150.png |
+| H3 different hypothetical example | M1-64_hint_3.png | M1-64_hint_3_150.png |
+| Missing-media teaching text | M1-64_missing_clip.png | M1-64_missing_clip_150.png |
+| How to card | M1-64_first_time_how_to.png | M1-64_how_to_150.png |
+| What now context and entry | M1-64_what_now.png | M1-64_what_now_150.png |
+| Genuine world H1 with authored clue | M1-64_world_nudge.png | M1-64_world_nudge_150.png |
+| Journal entry | M1-64_journal_hint_entry.png | M1-64_journal_hint_entry_150.png |
+| Genuine Journal H2 | M1-64_journal_shared_hint.png | M1-64_journal_shared_hint_150.png |
+
+Additional states: `M1-64_hint_2_replay.png`, `M1-64_how_to_concept.png`, `M1-64_table_more.png`, `M1-64_reduced_motion_still_150.png`, `M1-64_reduced_motion_still_150_held.png`, `M1-64_reduced_motion_captions_off_150.png`. The concept heading is independent of hint progress. More offers no legacy own-answer ladder or autofill action.
+
+Reproduce all states with `"$GODOT" --path game --windowed --script res://tools/capture_hint_player.gd`. Targeted modes append `-- --still-only` or `-- --context-only`. Check printed result lines and inspect actual PNGs; an engine exit code alone is not evidence.
+
+Skipped: physical gamepad hardware and learner usability trials. Keyboard and injected controller events, real clip playback, alarm freeze/resume, nested pause/focus, preference corruption/write failure and state preservation are covered. Full integration acceptance remains pending.
